 "tableCaption": [
  "70 tasks per configuration at pass@1, same browser tool, 10-minute budget; time, cost, tokens and steps are per-task means.",
  "Tasks were written in batches and run on Claude Sonnet 5, Claude Opus 5 and Muse Spark 1.2 at low thinking; a task was kept when a configuration failed it on two independent attempts (pass@2), or when it covered browser-control work the set would otherwise lack; every kept failure was checked by hand.",
  "29 tasks count or track something in a rendered video clip: occupancy peaks, events attributed to actors, direction-filtered crossings, defects on a belt.",
  "The rest are exact visual work on generated images (rotated or occluded shapes, a line traced through crossings, an angle, a gauge, an unnumbered clock), browser workflows on local web apps (multi-page checkout, password reset through an in-app inbox, keyboard-only and hover-only UIs, a form inside a shadow root inside an iframe, table editing with conflicts), and 8 read-only tasks on live GitHub, Wikipedia and JS Paint.",
  "Scoring: the 62 local-app tasks are scored from the server's state after the run (their private endpoints are gated, so calling the API instead of using the page yields nothing); the 8 live-site tasks are judged by a Claude Sonnet judge against API ground truth. Runs that hit a provider rate or usage limit were voided and rerun.",
  "Cost is the CLI's reported cost for Claude and list prices applied to captured token usage for the others; runs took place one per AWS instance. A Claude run killed at the 10-minute budget reports no cost, so 46 such runs (Opus 5 max 4; Opus 5 xhigh 1; Sonnet 5 high 5; Sonnet 5 max 22; Sonnet 5 medium 3; Sonnet 5 xhigh 11) are missing from the cost means; every other metric includes them.",
  "Partial and not shown: GPT-6 Astra medium, high, xhigh, max; GPT-5.6 Luna low, medium, high, xhigh, max.",
  "[Tasks](https://github.com/jshan9078/web-bench/tree/main/tasks) \u00b7 [design log](https://github.com/jshan9078/web-bench/blob/main/tasks/V2-DESIGN.md) \u00b7 [per-run results](https://github.com/jshan9078/web-bench/tree/main/results)"
